ary":"[bold #D75FFF]◆ EPIC bob-cli-j5.2.1[/bold #D75FFF]\n[dim]  Title: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]Guarded archive writer with preview and JSON[/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]   Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]Archive writes preserve concurrent edits and recoverable history, [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]detect exact replays, regroup sources, and expose a [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]side-effect-free preview and versioned JSON report.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]3[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]3[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202611/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]guarded_archive_writer.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202611/guarded_archive_writer.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim] Parent: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202611/done_notes_archiving_fixes.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-j5.2.1[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-j5/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]bob-cli-j5.2.1.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Support recoverable creation in the guarded write engine[/bold #D7AFFF]      [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]guarded-create[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]guarded-create: extend task_status_hooks_write to create previously [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]missing files safely, preserving replacement guards and recording [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]missing before-images for recovery.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Plan archive changes from captured inputs[/bold #D7AFFF]                     [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]archive-snapshot[dim] · [dim][/dim]after guarded-create[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]archive-snapshot: capture every archive-planning input once, detect [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]exact block replays, regroup changed sources, and validate final [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]postimages before constructing the guarded WritePlan.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Apply archive plans under the lock and expose preview and JSON[bold black on #FFD75F][/bold #D7AFFF] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]archive-command[dim] · [dim][/dim]after archive-snapshot[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]archive-command: integrate bounded guarded retries with standalone and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]nightly execution, add dry-run and versioned JSON reports, preserve [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]scoped Git behavior, and finish documentation and command regressions.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-j5.2.1","llm_provider":"grok","model":"grok-4.6","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-j5.2.1.1","reasoning_effort":"high","role_suffix":"plan","vcs_provider":"GitHub","workflow_name":"bob-cli-j5.2.1.1"},"source_run_id":"run-680e3f0077094a766e57bfd2eee681ca","started_at":"2026-11-09T17:22:13.939227+00:00","state":"completed"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":["prompt"],"restartable":false},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"395f84ac2470b7bdde8adf87bd281ede9db765a8045c73c45a75d9a482e29ae3","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-j5.2--mon/chat.md","size_bytes":2853},"commits":{"digest":"d48e051d90a34d5c0eeb7a530bffb0c46910ec958923b194ddf86c6eb92309a6","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-j5.2--mon/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"meta":{"digest":"dfc6245b01223afe33ef04b2270be1aa78619e71708758b0381609ea7f37c8cd","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-j5.2--mon/meta.json","size_bytes":754},"state":{"digest":"ec960c876cdbdda65ef7e97e19b7d494d279fd991916ba4279b3b094778a8eb9","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-j5.2--mon/state.json","size_bytes":213}},"finished_at":"2026-11-09T17:21:47.481117+00:00","global_name":"bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-j5.2--mo